{
  "scope": "Retrospective direct comparison of physical 182-byte wire packets on independently received, paired original streams. Candidate generation and header checks use the source alone. For each damaged source packet, an unchanged distinct quarter anchors its row and the peer supplies the comparison target only if the transmitted header and CRC pass there. Counts are conditional on those witnesses, and exclude unaligned rows. No proposal is incorporated into accepted receiver coverage.",
